{"about_the_game":"Byte The Dust is a <strong> Precision Platformer </strong>  set within a single expansive level, where even the slightest mistake can send players all the way back to the beginning.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3190620/extras/cb87f5bf18525ddd1c75ed5d4ed7cd24.avif?t=1755208855\" width=462 height=174 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple Controls, Challenging Game</h2> You run, and you jump. That's it! The simple controls make the game easy to pick up and play. But don't be deceived, these carefully crafted platforming sections are sure to give you a real challenge!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3190620/extras/9f619e791647bc8d0f66d1aa7da87c47.poster.avif?t=1755208855\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3190620/extras/9f619e791647bc8d0f66d1aa7da87c47.apng?t=1755208855\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beware Of The Punish Tube!</h2>Should you be unfortunate enough to fail a jump, you might just see yourself fall into the punish tube. It is a one way ride all the way back to start.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3190620/extras/14144d8f796d17a98f3df1688b647fee.poster.avif?t=1755208855\" width=750 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3190620/extras/14144d8f796d17a98f3df1688b647fee.webm?t=1755208855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3190620/extras/14144d8f796d17a98f3df1688b647fee.mp4?t=1755208855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"na